WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.374
Hi, I'm Doily!

00:00:02.374 --> 00:00:05.986
Long agent research runs stop improving while they stay busy.

00:00:05.986 --> 00:00:08.875
This harness notices, and sends agents somewhere new.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.785
Keep a compact dashboard of every experiment.

00:00:12.785 --> 00:00:16.960
When progress stalls, push a group of agents to disagree on purpose.

00:00:19.217 --> 00:00:22.475
An evolution loop changes a parent and scores the child.

00:00:22.475 --> 00:00:24.429
Every attempt lands in an archive.

00:00:24.849 --> 00:00:28.237
Scripts written before the run turn each attempt into one row

00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:29.469
of twenty five numbers.

00:00:29.889 --> 00:00:31.666
A monitor watches the best score.

00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:34.035
Flat for twenty minutes, and the search pauses.

00:00:34.455 --> 00:00:38.484
A cohort of agents scans the rows, opens a few full attempts,

00:00:38.484 --> 00:00:40.498
and runs its proposals in parallel.

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:41.841
Then the search resumes.

00:00:43.275 --> 00:00:45.861
One shared dashboard gives everyone the same idea.

00:00:45.861 --> 00:00:47.800
So the agents are pushed apart.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.198
Each agent sees a different random subset of the metrics.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:55.413
Each proposes eight directions at once, so the unusual ones survive.

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:59.258
Each builds on a different branch of the history, not the current best.

00:01:00.608 --> 00:01:03.724
Other fixes reset the agent and keep only the files.

00:01:03.724 --> 00:01:04.971
That loses the map.

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:08.817
This one keeps a row per experiment, and opens the full record

00:01:08.817 --> 00:01:09.960
only when it matters.

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:15.145
On the kernel task, the best case goes from twelve seventy five

00:01:15.145 --> 00:01:16.677
cycles to eleven oh nine.

00:01:16.677 --> 00:01:17.596
One run each.

00:01:18.967 --> 00:01:22.674
On a machine learning benchmark, it medals in seventeen of twenty

00:01:22.674 --> 00:01:24.021
two competitions, every seed.

00:01:24.021 --> 00:01:26.717
How much is the cohort is not shown.

00:01:28.225 --> 00:01:29.744
Don't throw the history away.

00:01:29.744 --> 00:01:33.084
Index it, and make the agents disagree when the search stalls.

00:01:35.775 --> 00:01:36.831
Score every attempt.

00:01:36.831 --> 00:01:38.590
Pause when progress goes flat.

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:40.702
Send the agents out different ways.

00:01:41.122 --> 00:01:43.240
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:43.845
I'm Doily.

00:01:43.845 --> 00:01:44.148
Bye!
